{%- comment -%}
THE HYUN — product page, ported 1:1 from /product/curated-collection
(theme-port/index.html). The buy area is the Storefront API widget: one
Frequency choice drives both the variant and the selling plan.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'hyun-nav' %}

<section class="section-26">
  <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    <div class="columns-24 w-row">
      <div class="column-49 w-col w-col-6">
        <div class="div-block-14">
          {%- if product.featured_image -%}
            <img loading="lazy" width="550" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}" src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1100 }}" class="image-11"/>
          {%- else -%}
            <img loading="lazy" width="550" alt="" src="{{ 'subth.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="image-11"/>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="column-24 w-col w-col-6">
        <div class="text-block-39 w-dyn-bind-empty"></div>
        <div class="div-block-19">
          <div class="text-block-36">{{ product.title }}</div>
          {%- if product.metafields.webflow.korean_name != blank -%}
            <div class="text-block-43">{{ product.metafields.webflow.korean_name }}</div>
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="text-block-43 w-dyn-bind-empty"></div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- if product.description != blank -%}
          <p class="paragraph-19">{{ product.description | strip_html }}</p>
        {%- else -%}
          <p class="paragraph-19 w-dyn-bind-empty"></p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if product.metafields.webflow.contents != blank -%}
          <div class="rich-text-block-3 w-richtext">{{ product.metafields.webflow.contents }}</div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="rich-text-block-3 w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext"></div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- comment -%}
        Price placeholder block: the widget renders the real price.
        Keeping the empty block preserves the original spacing.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="div-block-18"></div>
        <div class="hyun-buy-block">
          {%- if product.handle == 'curated-collection' -%}
            {%- comment -%}
            Buy widget in native mode — pairs the Frequency variant with the
            matching selling plan so they can never mismatch. Variant/plan IDs
            are Liquid-rendered below; checkout goes through the Cart AJAX
            API. No Storefront token needed on-theme.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {% render 'hyun-product-json', for_product: product %}
            <div data-hyun-buy="{{ product.handle }}"></div>
          {%- else -%}
            {%- comment -%}
            Every other product: Shopify's native cart form — no Storefront
            token needed, works as-is on the dev store.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- comment -%}
            Same classes as the live Webflow commerce form so thyun.css keeps
            styling it (quantity-5 stays hidden, secondary-button look).

            The price shown is the selected variant's, not price_min: with a
            weight picker those differ, and the live page rebound the price on
            every change (Webflow's commerce runtime). assets/site.js does the
            same here, so the number on screen is always the one that will be
            charged.

            A product with no price is not sold online in the source catalog;
            like the live template it shows no price and no form, but it still
            gets the unavailable notice rather than an empty column.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign shown = product.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: product.variants.first -%}
            {%- if shown.price > 0 -%}
              <div class="text-block-37 product-price" data-price-display>{{ shown.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | replace: '$', '$ ' }} </div>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if product.available and shown.price > 0 -%}
              {%- form 'product', product, class: 'w-commerce-commerceaddtocartform default-state-3' -%}
                {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
                  <select name="id" class="option-select-field hyun-buy-select" data-variant-select>
                    {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
                      <option value="{{ variant.id }}"
                              data-price="{{ variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | replace: '$', '$ ' }}"
                              {% if variant.id == shown.id %}selected{% endif %}
                              {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
                        {{ variant.title }} — {{ variant.price | money }}
                      </option>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </select>
                {%- else -%}
                  <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ shown.id }}"/>
                {%- endunless -%}
                <input type="number" pattern="^[0-9]+$" inputmode="numeric" name="quantity" min="1" class="w-commerce-commerceaddtocartquantityinput quantity-5" value="1"/>
                <input type="submit" class="w-commerce-commerceaddtocartbutton secondary-button" value="Add to Cart"/>
              {%- endform -%}
            {%- else -%}
              <div class="w-commerce-commerceaddtocartoutofstock out-of-stock-state" tabindex="0"><div class="text-block-100">This cut is currently unavailable</div></div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cream-section">
  <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    <div class="div-block-15">
      <p class="paragraph-20">Wrap your genuine emotions within the Bojagi enriched with THE HYUN&#x27;s artistry, offering a heartfelt expression of your sincerity</p>
      <p class="paragraph-21">We&#8217;re pleasured to offer gift wrapping with a traditional Korean wrapping cloth, Bojagi.<br/>This exquisite material, graced by the masterful hands of HYUN, surpasses its practical purpose; it encapsulates the heartfelt wish for the recipient to sense genuine warmth and admiration.</p>
      <a href="/pages/bojagi" class="primary-button tertiarybtn w-button">Learn more</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% render 'hyun-footer' %}
